+### Final generation prompt
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept.
+Asset type: ONE mobile game key art / art-direction reference, 1080x1920 pixels, portrait 9:16.
+Primary request: The royal potter's open-air workshop in a castle courtyard, a calm cosy funny storybook pottery game.
+Composition: A large potter's wheel occupies the lower third, with a half-thrown hollow round watchtower of wet terracotta clay centered on its spinning wheelhead. Its unfinished thick open rim, slight wobble, horizontal throwing rings and wet highlights make it unmistakably hand-thrown pottery. Behind it in the middle distance stands a small whimsical castle assembled from glazed pottery towers: a round watchtower, squat keep, turret, onion dome and slender spire, joined by low cream ceramic walls. Every tower has clear horizontal wheel-thrown rings, a pronounced pottery lip/rim, glossy glaze and small cloth pennant. Keep the castle clearly readable and separated from the foreground clay tower. A few simple glaze bowls and pottery tools on warm wooden surfaces frame the wheel; a small warm kiln is tucked to one side of the courtyard. Sky and a few simple cloud shapes above, understated sage plants at the edges. All major subjects within frame.
+Style/medium: Toon LOW-POLY 3D game render, clearly faceted polygonal volumes, flat colour areas, precisely 2–3 hard cel-shading bands, thick warm dark outlines (#2a2420). Broad simple silhouettes and chunky rounded forms. Soft warm sunlight in mood but stepped hard-band shading, no painterly texture.
+Palette: muted terracotta clay, cream plaster, warm wood, sage green, sky blue, kiln-gold and dusty rose, with dark brown outline #2a2420. Glazed castle towers alternate these gentle ceramic colours. Glaze has sparse graphic cream highlight shapes, clay is visibly wet and unglazed. Welcoming, playful and tactile.
+Constraints: No text, no lettering, no logo, no watermark, no UI, no border, no collage. No photorealism, no noisy texture, no oversaturation, no realistic stone fortress; the castle is visibly made of pottery. Produce one complete portrait image.
+```

